{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your deck and upgrade it, find and buy powerful artifacts to make your characters stronger and to surprise your opponents on a battlefield by creating unique strategies to carve your path through many difficult fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 24 story mode battles with three difficulty levels. Can you beat them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf PvP mode: create a strong team and compete with other players to get to the top of the ladder and get your rank among the best</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Make your party unique: train units and hire new ones, buy artifacts and collect a deck of magic cards which are perfect for your strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A beautiful standout 2D hand-drawn graphics and rotoscoping animation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A captivating story which is prequel to Ash of Gods: Redemption's storyline</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4162150?t=1771317235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4162150?t=1771317235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162150/c4142523d312328d2a8b1d5f86a315995630c9df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771317235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162150/c4142523d312328d2a8b1d5f86a315995630c9df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771317235","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your deck and upgrade it, find and buy powerful artifacts to make your characters stronger and to surprise your opponents on a battlefield by creating unique strategies to carve your pa